  "content": "\n\n<p>-嘿！有新的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">花</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">朵</span>！</p>\n<p>-真的假的？</p>\n<p>-沒錯！！你可以合成它、<span style=\"color:#592f02\">吃</span>掉它&hellip; 嗯&hellip;</p>\n<p>-<span style=\"color:#592f02\">吃</span>？！</p>\n<p>-對啊&hellip; 呃&hellip; 還有種<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">新礦石</span>！</p>\n<p>-喔，太棒了！那是什麼？</p>\n<p>-這是&hellip; <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><em>玫瑰鈷礦</em></span>！</p>\n<p>-太讚了，我<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>現在</strong></span>就要試試看！</p>",
